{"api": 1, "name": "gate-keepalive",
 "description": "The TC(20,128) timeout and the NOMINAL-entry re-arm (plan R1, OpModeMgmt.c:565-566 -> HWConfig.c:389-398): in NOMINAL the 0x142E comes 30 s after the LATER of the last TC(20,128) and the NOMINAL entry. The keep-alive stops at +65 and NOMINAL is entered at +75, so 0x142E is forbidden until +102 (a timer not re-armed would fire at ~+95) and awaited by +115 (re-armed: ~+105), then the move NOMINAL -> SAFE (0021 05 02). The mode TCs are GS emulation (tc.gs.send, as nominal-smoke's TC(236,1)); no S20=0 is sent.",
 "duration_s": 125,
 "setup": [{"do": "platform.power.on"}],
 "steps": [
  {"at": 0, "name": "boot", "do": "platform.power.boot",
   "await_event": [{"eid": "14a3", "timeout_s": 50}],
   "assert_no_event": [{"eid": "142e", "for_s": 65}]},
  {"at": 55, "name": "CONFIGURATION", "do": "tc.gs.send",
   "args": {"service": 236, "subtype": 1, "data": "0400"},
   "await_event": [{"eid": "0021", "data": "0204", "timeout_s": 10}]},
  {"at": 65, "name": "keep-alive off", "do": "platform.keepalive.set",
   "args": {"enabled": false},
   "assert_no_event": [{"eid": "142e", "for_s": 37}]},
  {"at": 75, "name": "NOMINAL (re-arms the TC20 timer)",
   "do": "tc.gs.send",
   "args": {"service": 236, "subtype": 1, "data": "0500"},
   "await_event": [{"eid": "0021", "data": "0405", "timeout_s": 10},
                   {"eid": "142e", "timeout_s": 40},
                   {"eid": "0021", "data": "0502", "timeout_s": 45}]}],
 "teardown": [{"do": "platform.power.off"}]}
